845 0 obj
<<
/Title (SAMADHAN is more than just a complaint portal. It is a comprehensive grievance management ecosystem designed to bridge the communication gap between students and the administration. By replacing scattered emails and informal communication with a centralized digital workflow, the platform ensures that every complaint is acknowledged, automatically assigned to the appropriate authority, monitored through every stage of resolution, and supported by real-time notifications and analytics. This not only improves transparency and accountability but also enables the institute to identify recurring issues, optimize resource allocation, and enhance the overall campus experience.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 414 0 R
>>
endobj
